<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19302" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάμμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάπτω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that in which a thing is dipped,
				dye,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				956a
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάμμα Σαρδιανικόν, Κυζικηνικόν,</span>
			
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάπτω</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1.2
			</span></i>: in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάφορα β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					914.7
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(v A. D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β.
			λευκώματος</span> a whitish <i>tinge,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Phgn.</u>
				813a28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sauce,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				622
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάμβα.</span>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				362
			</span></i>.</div>
